***** GEPRÜFT Ventilatory/ Respiratory System
Initiated by Cartoid body sensing low arterial po2 and increased lactate.
activates sympathetic nervous system mediated acute ventilatory chemo reflex
response. Leading to Pulmunary vasoconstriction increasing Minute Ventilation

- Progressive augmentation of Hypoxic Ventilary Response (HVR) during IH
- Serotonin Triggered long term facilitation (vLTF)

